In portrait the gimbal panel now only takes the space its controls need. Osmo Nano no longer shows zoom controls, and DISP lists Zoom Chip and Gimbal Stick only when the camera has them. New: Osmo Action 6 support with live view, Normal 10-bit and D-Log M color with the official LUT, and an APERTURE control in place of FOCUS. Also new: experimental Multiview for up to four Pocket or Nano cameras. Fixed: live video stopping shortly after connecting, and clip delete in playback.
